            <div xml:id="m-5be08e31-f2c9-461d-b3da-41cfceb5d94b">
              <lg xml:id="m-1a9a2b27-ff28-40b5-b73b-a0896b6ba2f9">
                <l xml:id="m-c68d7ef2-c957-4eaf-8ea5-ad0cda1f7199" facs="#m-745e0a50-347b-4ddb-af24-f5f435703f33" label="ambiguous">282</l><l xml:id="m-e22a2d7e-f98f-4e24-a5a0-cf8541b6f150" facs="#m-640c38bd-cf62-4688-a4cb-262418e86468" label="text-like">Sunday at Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-bfed2572-696e-4906-a9f2-79f45a04fc5b" facs="#m-cbc44cfa-3e75-4310-8d33-ce79536523ca" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in princípio, et nûne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6141732-b748-4491-94f6-1ff99bee3637" facs="#m-2d40947f-4872-4fd4-855b-b39cc97273f9" label="ambiguous">lorum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-d3463d86-a45d-4de8-bfea-cd7876492459" facs="#m-468d4b43-0a24-4861-bddb-bca8f9c447e6" label="lyrics-like">Ait the Psalms end thas with the doxology Glória Pátri. unless the</l><l xml:id="m-502bf334-ba7e-4193-96a6-a658f7122358" facs="#m-7e874e5a-48b0-4032-b417-411e5e57cfc7" label="ambiguous">contrary be indicated.</l><l xml:id="m-c1f3e11a-36d8-49f2-ae97-4258f695c972" facs="#m-3dbd574c-923f-4c71-a179-eaf0759f78d1" label="lyrics-like">P. T. Ps. Confitébor. 7. C. p. 139.</l><l xml:id="m-c796c32b-6a8e-4720-a80c-cccd2a3d8858" facs="#m-f8633150-28b3-442c-aa8d-209e97ecad60" label="ambiguous">Ant. B</l><l xml:id="m-228d5b96-18f5-458e-bac0-49d04547fefe" facs="#m-f7843cf8-d4a6-42c9-a71a-64a0d7c3ad80" label="lyrics-like">Díxit Dóminus Dómino mé-o: Séde a déxtris mé-is.</l><l xml:id="m-3682b8ef-8ef5-4d06-b12a-13028ae2ff87" facs="#m-c9e84a5d-e1c6-4c4f-81d3-91368c30a4c3" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.t</l><l xml:id="m-ae419376-38b0-444c-987e-f2029e8d7137" facs="#m-ee739a89-4566-4163-ae10-44074847d959" label="ambiguous">3.b</l><l xml:id="m-089d914b-4e76-48e4-8ba8-c2297c92e23b" facs="#m-ba7c4774-e413-44df-bfc3-370195d1f2cc" label="lyrics-like">Agna ópera Dómi-ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-eee6a0d3-4793-4820-9748-f5a6039b0217" facs="#m-caad69ec-ca48-4120-9881-ac8644153691" label="ambiguous">Psalm 110.</l><l xml:id="m-615eff06-3015-4ca7-9481-64538d115798" facs="#m-f4089d5a-599a-480b-89e4-ec778b0e3cb4" label="lyrics-like">1. Confitébor tíbi Dómine in tóto cór-de mé¬in con¬</l><l xml:id="m-51cd91df-c48e-46cd-968b-90595da77b2b" facs="#m-c131f97f-c802-4b40-bf57-c7e908f79670" label="lyrics-like">sí-li-o justórum, et congrega-ti-6̂-ne. Flex: su-órum,</l><l xml:id="m-cc2d0a86-5912-49ef-9bbf-a7539a0b3628" facs="#m-64b85607-64e3-450d-85c1-2b0115e00bcc" label="lyrics-like">2. Mágna ópera Dómini:*exquisita in ômnes voluntátes éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-d9a2feeb-9ae1-467d-b2bb-b91caf0bf34f" facs="#m-36a5a932-a798-491c-abfa-f89a2a6ecd03" label="lyrics-like">3. Conféssio et magnificéntia ópus éjus: * et justítia éjus mánet in</l><l xml:id="m-6e96ea93-801e-4e76-aa9c-12b8c0f13c0c" facs="#m-2f4a12b1-1bcc-4ab6-8713-60ffe9463016" label="lyrics-like">saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-837c680b-afa8-4899-ac69-12d7a3347f5a" facs="#m-86ef520c-848f-49b5-9641-6f663fe7edd9" label="lyrics-like">4. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum, t miséricors et miserátor</l><l xml:id="m-8fde9d10-1a05-4e31-bfeb-b8895cefcd08" facs="#m-e5841028-dd6e-4b02-a03a-436a2d3d9a49" label="lyrics-like">bóminus:“éscam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-91b8b0cc-1022-4c66-b3d1-60fc66819524" facs="#m-62754e71-99b7-4dae-853b-b515ca8f778c" label="lyrics-like">5. Mémor érit in saéculum testaménti súi :“* virtútem óperum suórum</l><l xml:id="m-e82a6d78-4aba-4711-9e21-5daec522c82a" facs="#m-33e0e545-9453-4b96-b925-a00a7a7c3063" label="lyrics-like">annuntiábit póputo súo:</l><l xml:id="m-f4b7cc67-c331-492e-a8b3-c9f050796a52" facs="#m-56322488-6511-404a-b659-83279e71d5ed" label="lyrics-like">6. Ut det illis haereditátem géntium:* ópera mánuum éjus véritas et</l><l xml:id="m-516ab8d9-defd-466f-b5ce-1fc2a3572f9e" facs="#m-e3d22770-8691-439b-8538-5b2e0870da82" label="ambiguous">fadicium.</l><l xml:id="m-1eb64516-9544-4871-8320-c2be5340ef23" facs="#m-b15202b4-5665-42db-b5ab-a8b5755cfa15" label="lyrics-like">7. Fidélia ómnia mandáta éjus:t confirmáta in saéculum saéculi:</l><l xml:id="m-4a07a5bc-2faf-4873-88bb-db73cafeef67" facs="#m-8eb85383-72e4-435f-8e72-baccceefcf5c" label="lyrics-like">fácta in veritáte et aequitâte.</l><l xml:id="m-bfa9eb52-e6f5-41e7-b3c9-7f4a20f06ae6" facs="#m-6b7fbfd1-c9ce-463e-8df2-86d37f15ebc2" label="lyrics-like">8. Redemptiónem misit pópulo súo:*mandávit in aetérnum testa¬</l><l xml:id="m-39a3fe34-3500-43ea-a916-71a9532ed6e5" facs="#m-a4c9d652-e713-4d0d-9ada-8c1043779c99" label="lyrics-like">méntum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-fa54ed0d-ac26-456b-b8a3-2ea742a9d770" facs="#m-1854ee77-4375-4a97-bf94-95e94d97bfdf" label="lyrics-like">9. Sánctum et terribile nómen éjus :* inítium sapiéntiae tímor Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-b526e6c2-849e-4ea4-8743-d8a1fe8e1979" facs="#m-a3166c28-f4af-4f6a-b2c1-da26968c972e" label="lyrics-like">10. Intelléctus bónus ómnibus faciéntibus éum :* laudátio éjus mánet</l><l xml:id="m-25604c35-0f3e-44c5-b7a3-e27789b0eb0c" facs="#m-0c8350b3-fb9f-4475-a7c0-de964c3e9f4a" label="lyrics-like">in saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-9411c959-e81f-46f8-9c94-788db718d994" facs="#m-87b6fec7-d600-4b87-b916-88f700fc2209" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pâtri, et Fillo, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-b199bdb8-8a79-4e6b-a499-bd12ccac20d2" facs="#m-4cf637a0-1004-4563-a638-fc437733f344" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in principio, et nûne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9671ff5-6b45-4e5d-8eeb-8edab6cac495" facs="#m-ccca9a1c-cdff-4a88-ba4e-12b119bee293" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5383680d-bf1f-4445-8631-4a7b548aa3ad" facs="#m-9fd336b2-8f37-481a-8717-d237db8e8fe2" label="lyrics-like">2 T. Ps. Beátus vir. 7. ca. p. 146.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>